OL,3,AAndrew Tate exaggerates and did not own
OL,4,Asupercars in photos, his lawyers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial influencer Andrew Tate
OL,7,Fportrays himself as "uberwealthy" but
OL,8,Fdid not own cars and a yacht featured
OL,9,Fon his social media and exaggerated his
OL,10,Flifestyle for online attention, his
OL,11,Flegal representatives have said.
OL,13,FTate and his brother Tristan are
OL,14,Fcurrently being held in a Florida jail
OL,15,Fbut are seeking release on bail while
OL,16,Fthey await the outcome of extradition
OL,17,Fproceedings.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
