OL,3,AAndrew Tate exaggerates and did not own
OL,4,Asupercars in photos, his lawyers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were arrested last month after
OL,7,FBritish prosecutors unveiled new
OL,8,Fcharges including alleged sexual
OL,9,Foffences against them, which both men
OL,10,Fdeny.
OL,12,FProsecutors have argued the Tates are a
OL,13,F"flight risk", citing the brothers'
OL,14,Fpast statements about their wealth and
OL,15,Finfluence and having multiple
OL,16,Fidentities to evade the law.
